{
  "id": "ep137",
  "duration": 52.692,
  "beats": [
    {
      "start": 0.08,
      "end": 4.691,
      "text": "To survive the first spacewalk, Alexei Leonov had to bleed his oxygen.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Alexey Leonov in 1965 02.jpg",
        "credit": "\u0413\u043b\u0430\u0432\u0430\u0440\u0445\u0438\u0432 \u041c\u043e\u0441\u043a\u0432\u044b",
        "license": "CC BY 4.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Alexey_Leonov_in_1965_02.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "end": 2.0,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 2.0,
          "end": 4.7,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 4.691,
      "end": 13.261,
      "text": "On March 18, 1965, the Soviet mission Voskhod 2 reached orbit with Leonov and commander Pavel Belyayev.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Soviet Union-1965-stamp-Pavel Belyayev-6K.jpg",
        "credit": "\u041f\u043e\u0447\u0442\u0430 \u0421\u0421\u0421\u0420",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Soviet_Union-1965-stamp-Pavel_Belyayev-6K.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 4.7,
          "end": 13.267,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 13.261,
      "end": 19.581,
      "text": "Ninety minutes after launch, Leonov floated into the vacuum, tethered only by a slender line.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Soviet Union-1965-Stamp-0.10. Voskhod-2. First Spacewalk.jpg",
        "credit": "Unknown author",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Soviet_Union-1965-Stamp-0.10._Voskhod-2._First_Spacewalk.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 13.267,
          "end": 15.633,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 15.633,
          "end": 19.567,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 19.581,
      "end": 25.976,
      "text": "But after twelve minutes outside, his suit ballooned and stiffened so much he could no longer bend his joints.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Leonov suit.jpg",
        "credit": "Nijuuf",
        "license": "CC BY 3.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Leonov_suit.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 19.567,
          "end": 25.967,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 25.976,
      "end": 32.421,
      "text": "Leonov\u2019s hands slipped from his gloves, leaving him unable to pull himself back through the airlock door.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Voskhod-2 airlock and spacesuit.jpg",
        "credit": "Kucharek",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Voskhod-2_airlock_and_spacesuit.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 25.967,
          "end": 29.2,
          "kind": "cover",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 29.2,
          "end": 32.433,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 32.421,
      "end": 40.066,
      "text": "Without telling ground control, Leonov opened a valve to release his life-sustaining pressure just to squeeze inside.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Voskhod Spacecraft Life Support Unit (54838030429).jpg",
        "credit": "Steve Jurvetson",
        "license": "CC BY 4.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Voskhod_Spacecraft_Life_Support_Unit_(54838030429).jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 32.433,
          "end": 35.367,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        },
        {
          "start": 35.367,
          "end": 40.067,
          "kind": "detail",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 40.066,
      "end": 47.641,
      "text": "After a manual reentry, the crew crash-landed deep in the Ural Mountains and spent two nights among wolves and bears.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "\u0417\u0438\u043c\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u0417\u044e\u0440\u0430\u0442\u043a\u0443\u043b\u044c.jpg",
        "credit": "Anastasia",
        "license": "CC BY 4.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%D0%97%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B9_%D0%97%D1%8E%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%BA%D1%83%D0%BB%D1%8C.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 40.067,
          "end": 47.633,
          "kind": "cover",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "start": 47.641,
      "end": 52.342,
      "text": "Leonov had faced orbital death because his suit became a pressurized prison.",
      "asset": {
        "source": "Wikimedia Commons",
        "title": "Alexey Leonov in 1965 02.jpg",
        "credit": "\u0413\u043b\u0430\u0432\u0430\u0440\u0445\u0438\u0432 \u041c\u043e\u0441\u043a\u0432\u044b",
        "license": "CC BY 4.0",
        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Alexey_Leonov_in_1965_02.jpg"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "start": 47.633,
          "end": 52.7,
          "kind": "card",
          "motion": "camera"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
